            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided herein is an elastomeric matrix, comprising poly(vinyl alcohol) (PVOH); water, and one or more plasticizers. A combined mass ratio of the one or more plasticizers to said PVOH is at least 2: 1.</p>
